# %% CELL 11 — CORRELATION HEATMAP
# -----------------------------------------------------------
# A correlation heatmap shows pairwise linear associations between all
# numeric features and the target.  Key questions we want to answer:
#   - Which feature correlates most strongly with Contract value?
#   - Are any features highly inter-correlated (multicollinearity risk
#     for Linear Regression)?
# We use Seaborn's heatmap with annotation so precise values are visible.
